      "widgets_values": [
        "## Newspaper Layouts\n\n### 91. Vintage Newspaper Front Page - Multi-Column Layout\n```\nDesign a vintage newspaper front page layout for \"The Daily Herald\" dated October 24, 2025, with a bold serif headline in Garamond font reading \"Graphic Design Revolution Sweeps the Nation\", multiple columns of body text in Times New Roman 10pt with justified alignment and lorem ipsum filler paragraphs discussing design trends, sidebars with subheadings in italicized Georgia font like \"Top Fonts of the Year\" and bullet points, integrated black-and-white photographs of designers with captions in sans-serif Arial, masthead in ornate script font like Edwardian Script at the top with city name and issue number, weather icon and date in small caps, full-page composition following grid system with 5 columns and balanced white space, monochromatic newsprint color harmony with subtle yellowing for aged effect, 12K resolution simulating folded paper texture, test prompt adherence with precise kerning and leading in all texts, creative integration of a decorative border, photorealistic as a printed broadsheet\n```"
      ],
